  "description": "Seon Jaehyeon keeps having dreams of a forgotten friend from middle school. But little does he know that friend is Han Dohoon, a college classmate who has heard some unsavory rumors about Jaehyeon. Believing these rumors as fact and mad that he’s been totally forgotten, Dohoon blackmails Jaehyeon into sleeping with him. But what starts as a mess of misunderstandings just might bring these two boys back to their short-lived and unfinished first love from all those years ago.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
